  "body": "Follow-up to #3307 for issue #2769. #3307 is merged and has the Manual Guide i blank writer and the `StockShape` PARAM contract.\n\n## What changed\n\nThe reconciliation merge (`eb8946bb4`) keeps the writer and the PARAM contract from #3307. It drops the duplicate contract of this branch:\n\n- the `StockBlank` / `StockBlankZBottom` PARAMs;\n- the `stockBlank = true` manifest flag;\n- the engine filter (`post::stock_blank`);\n- `posting_stock_blank.rs` and its app test.\n\nWhat this PR adds to main:\n\n- `assets/posts/fanuc.cps`: the `manualGuideBlank` option help now says: \"Series 30i background simulation ignores G20/G21; confirm the control unit setting\".\n- `crates/post/tests/fanuc_manual_guide_blank.rs`, three pins on the `StockShape` contract:\n  - `the_blank_option_explains_the_series_30i_simulation_unit_limit`\n  - `the_shape_params_keep_the_line_map_and_trace_on_the_input_records`: the line map and the trace record index of the feed line are the input stream's index, with the option off and on.\n  - `a_bar_with_the_origin_above_its_top_refuses_the_blank`: no `G1900` with a negative `K`.\n- `docs/decisions/2769-manual-guide-blank.md`: the reconciliation decision.\n\n## Not ported, and why\n\n- The refusals for an inverted machine axis and a flipped WCS. `post::invert` and `post::wcs_flip` mirror the stock box with the origin, so the `I J K` values of main are correct in the control frame.\n- The \"bar not round\" refusal. Main reads the true diameter from `StockShapeDiameter`.\n\n## Mutations (each red, then green after restore)\n\n- Help text sentence removed: the unit-help pin is red.\n- Negative-K guard in `fanuc.cps` disabled: the origin-above-top pin is red.\n- Engine drops the `StockShape*` records before it indexes them: the line-map pin is red.\n\n## Gate\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: green, 120 steps, 0 failed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- `fanuc_mgi_blank` (12) and `fanuc_manual_guide_blank` (3): pass.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No run on a real control.\n- Heavy lanes were not run on this head.\n\nChangelog: Fanuc post: the Manual Guide i blank option help names the Series 30i background-simulation unit limit.\n\nRefs #2769\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
